{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51821","headline":"丫头山 · 施逵","name":"丫头山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何不梳粧嫁去休，常教人唤作丫头。\n只因不信良媒说，躭阁千秋与万秋。\n（《古今图书集成·职方典》二八四《黄州府志》）（〖1〗弘治《黄州府志》卷七作苏轼诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"施逵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}